<title>USA: Catherines says sees lower Q3 results.</title>
<headline>Catherines says sees lower Q3 results.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Catherines Stores Corp said on Thursday that it does not expect to achieve the same third quarter results of operations that it reported in 1995.</p>
<p>Earlier, the company reported an 8.4 percent fall in September same-stored sales.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
